# Sprite Demo
# Shows how to create and move game characters

SAY "=== Sprite Demo ==="
SAY ""

CREATE SPRITE player
CREATE SPRITE enemy

MOVE SPRITE player TO 100 200
MOVE SPRITE enemy TO 300 150

SAY "Player and enemy created!"
SHOW SPRITE player
SHOW SPRITE enemy

WAIT 1

SAY "Moving player..."
MOVE SPRITE player TO 200 200

SAY "Hiding enemy..."
HIDE SPRITE enemy

SAY "Done!"
